// Local signing configuration template (App Store Task 2 — team ID moved out of the commit).
// Usage: copy this file to Signing.xcconfig and fill in your own Apple Developer team ID.
//   cp Signing.xcconfig.example Signing.xcconfig
// Signing.xcconfig is gitignored (repo root .gitignore). The committed Signing.base.xcconfig
// pulls it in via `#include?` (optional include), so even without the file, xcodegen generate
// and the unsigned test gate (CODE_SIGNING_ALLOWED=NO) pass as-is — it is only needed for
// Xcode Run/Archive, which requires signing.
DEVELOPMENT_TEAM = YOUR_TEAM_ID
